      "fr_FR": "Bienvenue!"
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_Dummy38",
      "garbage": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_PokecenterAllHappyAndHealthy",
      "en_US": [
        "There! All happy and healthy!\n",
        "Good luck and take care!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vos Pokémon ont été soignés.\r",
        "Nous vous souhaitons\n",
        "bonne chance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_YouHadQuiteTheExperienceOutThere",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Welcome home.\r",
        "It sounds like you had quite the\n",
        "experience out there.\r",
        "Maybe you should take a quick\n",
        "rest so you can relax.\r",
        "...\n",
        "..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Bienvenue à la maison, \n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. Tout va bien?\r",
        "Tu as dû vivre des \n",
        "aventures épuisantes.\r",
        "Tu devrais te reposer et \n",
        "faire une bonne sieste.\r",
        "...\n",
        "..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_PokemonLookingGreatBeforePokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: Oh, good! You and your\n",
        "Pokémon are looking great.\r",
        "Oh, yes, I heard from Professor\n",
        "Rowan.\r",
        "He said that a Pokémon’s energy is\n",
        "measured in HP (Hit Points).\r",
        "If your Pokémon lose their HP,\n",
        "you can restore it at any\f",
        "Pokémon Center.\r",
        "If you’re going to travel far away,\n",
        "the smart Trainer stocks up on\f",
        "Potions at the Pokémon Mart.\r",
        "Make me proud, honey!\n",
        "Take care!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Eh bien, toi et ton\n",
        "Pokémon avez l’air d’aller mieux.\r",
        "Je viens d’avoir des nouvelles\n",
        "du Professeur Sorbier.\r",
        "Il dit que l’énergie d’un Pokémon\n",
        "se mesure en PV (Points de Vie).\r",
        "Si ton Pokémon manque de PV, tu\n",
        "peux les restaurer en allant\f",
        "dans un Centre Pokémon.\r",
        "Et si tu prévois de voyager loin,\n",
        "n’oublie pas d’acheter des Potions\f",
        "dans une Boutique Pokémon.\r",
        "Rends-moi fière, mon bouchon.\n",
        "Fais attention à toi!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_PokemonLookingGreatAfterPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: Oh, good! You and your\n",
        "Pokémon are looking great.\r",
        "Oh yes, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your Pokémon\n",
        "will faint if it runs out of HP.\r",
        "If your Pokémon loses its HP, come\n",
        "home before it faints.\r",
        "It will be healed to full health by\n",
        "taking a rest.\r",
        "Well, honey, make me proud!\n",
        "Take care!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Eh bien, toi et ton\n",
        "Pokémon avez l’air d’aller mieux.\r",
        "Fais attention, ton Pokémon sera\n",
        "K.O. s’il perd tous ses PV.\r",
        "Si ton Pokémon perd des PV, \n",
        "reviens à la maison avant qu’il soit K.O.\r",
        "Il retrouvera tous ses PV \n",
        "après un peu de repos.\r",
        "Maman est fière de toi, mon bouchon.\n",
        "Fais attention à toi!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_PokecenterFirstRestorePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "First, let’s restore your Pokémon\n",
        "to full health."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Avant toute chose, vous devriez\n",
        "faire soigner vos Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_PokecenterHealedToPerfectHealth",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Pokémon have been healed\n",
        "to perfect health."
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Vos Pokémon ont été soignés."
    },
    {
      "id": "CommonStrings_Text_PokecenterGoodLuckTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "Please visit a Pokémon Center when\n",
        "your Pokémon’s HP goes down.\r",
        "If you’re planning to travel any\n",
        "distance, you should stock up on\f",
        "Potions at a Pokémon Mart.\r",
        "Good luck, Trainer!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Si les PV de vos Pokémon sont\n",
        "faibles, venez nous voir.\r",
        "Si vous prévoyez de partir loin,\n",
        "vous devriez acheter des Potions\f",
        "dans une Boutique Pokémon.\r",
        "Nous vous souhaitons\n",
        "bonne chance."
      ]
    },
